- "content": "\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.49), 19px);line-height:1.55\">The 18 sectors where NGOs, UN agencies and their partners work across Bangladesh, with the sub-sectors under each one. Choose a sector or sub-sector to see our latest news, research, funding and jobs in that area. The number in brackets shows how many stories we have published on each.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#4a4f57;margin-top:0px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55\"><strong>143 stories published</strong> · Counts updated 19 November 2026 · <strong>Reference:</strong> sectors and sub-sectors follow the classification of the <a href=\"https://ngoab.portal.gov.bd/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">NGO Affairs Bureau (NGOAB)</a>, Prime Minister&#8217;s Office, Government of Bangladesh.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:8px;padding-bottom:24px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-566884c3 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-radius:20px;background-color:#e8f3fb;padding-top:22px;padding-right:22px;padding-bottom:22px;padding-left:22px\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.392), 18px);line-height:1.3\">⚖️ <a href=\"/tag/public-order-and-safety/\">Public Order and Safety</a> (4)</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul style=\"color:#4a4f57;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6\" class=\"wp-block-list has-text-color\">\n<li><a href=\"/tag/human-rights/\">Human Rights</a> (18)</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"/tag/anti-trafficking-and-exploitation-prevention/\">Anti-Trafficking and Exploitation Pre